@startuml
' Report 4: supporting interaction
title HEALTH-NOTIFICATION - Background health notification
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
participant "ShrimpHealthService" as S
participant "NotificationsService" as N
participant "PrismaService" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
activate S
note over S
Continuation of a task already started by the request.
It does not delay the user confirmation.
end note
S -> P : 1. Load active recipient assignments
activate P
P -> DB : 2. Load active recipient assignments
activate DB
DB -->> P : 3. Staff recipients; owner supplied by caller
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 4. Staff recipients; owner supplied by caller
deactivate P
opt 4.1 Recipients exist
note over S
Classify health observations by severity.
end note
S -> N : 4.1.1. Create and deliver observation notification
activate N
' ref-target: NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY
ref over N : 4.1.2. Save and deliver notifications\n(NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY)
N -->> S : 4.1.3. Created notifications
deactivate N
opt 4.1.3.1 Current health observation is dangerous
S -> P : 4.1.3.1.1. Load three most recent health observations
activate P
P -> DB : 4.1.3.1.2. Load three most recent health observations
activate DB
DB -->> P : 4.1.3.1.3. Recent health observations
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 4.1.3.1.4. Recent health observations
deactivate P
opt 4.1.3.1.4.1 Three consecutive critical observations
S -> N : 4.1.3.1.4.1.1. Send repeated critical health warning
activate N
' ref-target: NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY
ref over N : 4.1.3.1.4.1.2. Save and deliver warning\n(NOTIFICATION-DELIVERY)
N -->> S : 4.1.3.1.4.1.3. Created warning
deactivate N
end
end
end
deactivate S
' Source references:
' backend/src/modules/shrimp-health/shrimp-health.service.ts:113 dispatchShrimpHealthNotification
' backend/src/modules/notifications/notifications.service.ts:318 notifyShrimpHealthUpdate
' backend/src/prisma/prisma.service.ts:11 PrismaService
@enduml
